INIBUILDS A350 PROSEDÜRÜ
1) BAŞLATMA (COLD AND DARK STARTUP)

    BATTERY 1-2: ON

    EXTERNAL POWER 1 & 2: ON

    IR 1-2-3 (IRS): NAV

    CREW SUPPLY: ON

    EMER EXIT LT: ARM

    NO SMOKING / SEAT BELTS: AUTO

    NAV / LOGO: ON / AUTO

    TABLET AYARLARI:
        SETTINGS > 3RD PARTY > SIMBRIEF ID: "GİR"
        SETTINGS > UNITS: KG (Litre yerine)
        SETTINGS > RUDDER CONTROLLER: ON (Taksi için kritik)

    FMS / MCDU HAZIRLIK:
        OIS > LOADSHEET > SIMBRIEF IMPORT > SET ZFW & FUEL
        MCDU > INIT > CPNY F-PLN REQUEST > INSERT
        F-PLN: SID/STAR manuel giriş (gerekiyorsa) > DISCONTINUITY SİL > INSERT
        PERF > TAKE OFF: V hızlarını hesapla > SYNC FMS

    APU ÇALIŞTIRMA:
        FUEL PUMPS: ON
        APU MASTER SW: ON
        APU START
        APU AVAIL (YEŞİL) > EXT PWR: OFF > APU BLEED: ON

2) PUSHBACK VE MOTOR ÇALIŞTIRMA

    BEACON: ON
    MODE SELECTOR: IGN START
    ENG 2: ON (Sağ motor)
    ENG 1: ON (Sol motor)
    Motorlar stabil olduktan sonra;
    MODE SELECTOR: NORM
    APU BLEED / APU MASTER: OFF
    TRIM: "OFP Değeri"
    FLAP: 1
    SPEED BRAKE: ARM (Tıkla)
    TO CONFIG: BAS (Yeşil olmalı)

3) KALKIŞ (TAKE OFF)

    TAXI LIGHT: ON
    RUNWAY (PİST BAŞI): LANDING LT: ON / STROBE: ON / TAKE-OFF: ON
    TRANS-PONDER (SUR): MOD: TA/RA (veya C)
    KRONOMETRE: BAŞLAT
    KALKIŞ: TOGA / FLEX

4) TIRMANMA VE SEYİR (CLIMB & CRUISE)

    GEAR: UP
    FLAP: UP (0)
    AUTOPILOT: ON
    SPEED BRAKE: RETRACTED (ARM OFF)
    10.000 FT: LANDING LT: OFF
    12.000 FT: BARO > STD

5) ALÇALMA (DESCENT) VE YAKLAŞMA

    TOP OF DESCENT (TOD): ALÇALMA BAŞLAT
    10.000 FT: LANDING LT: ON
    BARO: "GÜNCEL QNH"
    ILS FREQ/CRS: RAD-NAV > "FREQ" (Manuel girilmesi gerekebilir)
    TERRAIN / CSTR / LS: ON
    PERF > APPR: GİR

6) İNİŞ VE PARK

    FLAP: KADEMELİ AÇ / FULL
    GEAR: DOWN
    AUTOPILOT: OFF
    İniş sonrası: APU: ON / LANDING LT: OFF / STROBE: OFF
    Park: PARK BRAKE: ON / ENGINE 1-2: OFF / EXT PWR: ON
    DEBOARDING: BAŞLAT
